name 'aif-y2-ai-at-scale-lesson13-level8-2026'
title 'Present Your Work'



markdown <<MARKDOWN
Prepare a digital poster for your community showcasing your project and how it can help your community.

1. [Open this document](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1I1Zf2qHhJrTbTNZWtIjqpTcsywo6VZp043T_ele0yr0/edit) to access a poster template in Google Slides.
2. Go to **File → Make a copy** to make your own copy of the poster template.
3. Write in your project’s name and write about how your project can be used, its effectiveness, the data it was trained on, and what safeguards you put in place.
4. Change the layout, colors, and design to make the poster your own!

MARKDOWN
